  "title": "Beet and Pear Puree",
  "description": "Sweet Vidalia onions and Bosc pears are cooked in butter and cranberry vinegar and then pureed with roasted beets.",
  "authors": [
    "JULIEFAY"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:11:40-04:00",
